    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0223-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "Two good RCTs. One111 suggests superior efficacy to chlorpromazine in \nrefractory schizophrenia; the other109 suggests equivalence to clozapine in \nsubjects with treatment intolerance/resistance. Disappointing results in practice, \nhowever. Supratherapeutic doses offer no advantage.112\n",
